   1152 calendar entries across 46 seasons, 357 press answers, 26 sackings, every one exactly when the meter read zero
   single week falls in board confidence: median 4.7, p99 11.8, largest 12.4 (the bottom band starts under 10)
2) A broken promise, a press answer or a handshake can never leave the meter on zero with the manager in a job
   8 mid season base(s) and 10 promise base(s) kept from managers still in a job, 0 keep point(s) skipped for a sacking
